# Files oxlint should skip, in gitignore syntax, relative to this file.
#
# These used to live in `ignorePatterns` in .repo/config/oxlint/oxlint.config.json. As of
# oxlint 1.75 those patterns are resolved inside the config file's own directory, and `..`
# is rejected, so a config that isn't at the repo root can no longer point at anything
# outside itself. Hence this file, wired up with `--ignore-path` in the lint scripts.
# It has to live at the repo root: oxlint resolves these patterns relative to the ignore
# file, not to the working directory.

**/node_modules/
**/dist/
.direnv/
docs/
temp/
**/bin/
**/*.d.ts
**/*.g.mts
.repo/config/oxlint/plugin-local.mjs
